---
title: "syncAllRoles (stem-bot-v2: src/api/rolesSyncAll.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_fetch_all: supabase.from(members).is(deleted_at, null)
    q_fetch_all --> q_err_fetch: membersError or !members
    q_fetch_all --> q_check_empty: members loaded
    q_err_fetch --> [*]: res.status(500)
    q_check_empty --> q_respond_empty: members.length === 0
    q_check_empty --> q_iter_start: members.length > 0
    q_respond_empty --> [*]: res.json(synced 0)

    q_iter_start --> q_iter_member: for memberData of members
    q_iter_member --> q_get_discord: getMember(memberData.discord_uid)
    q_get_discord --> q_skip_member: member not found
    q_get_discord --> q_sync_gen_all: member found
    q_skip_member --> q_iter_next: results.failed++

    q_sync_gen_all --> q_sync_teams_all: sync generation role
    q_sync_teams_all --> q_sync_leader_all: sync team roles
    q_sync_leader_all --> q_sync_status_all: sync leader role
    q_sync_status_all --> q_sync_member_all: sync status role (JH/H/OB)
    q_sync_member_all --> q_sync_verified_all: sync member role
    q_sync_verified_all --> q_iter_next: results.synced++

    q_iter_next --> q_iter_member: next member
    q_iter_next --> q_respond: all members processed
    q_respond --> [*]: res.json(success, synced, failed, total, errors)

    note right of q_iter_start
        INV-001: Processes all non-deleted members sequentially (no concurrency limit)
        INV-002: Single member failure does not abort entire sync
        INV-003: No rate limiting on Discord API calls (N members x M roles each)
    end note

    note right of q_sync_teams_all
        INV-004: syncAllRoles does not remove non-member team roles (unlike syncRoles)
        INV-005: Error details are returned in response body (potential info leak)
    end note
